        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives a document re-photographing method that the caregiver can execute.",
          "quote": "请重新拍摄每张单据：平铺、光线充足、正对页面"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO4 (real-world constraint navigation) is partially completed. The doctor provides alternative observation methods (timing, video recording, no need for a blood pressure monitor) and a document re-photographing method. However, the doctor does not fully adapt the plan when the caregiver later confirms lack of a home blood pressure monitor; instead, the observation plan relies on responsiveness and breathing, which is already part of the emergency plan. The workflow omits a concrete, written home record format as explicitly required by the success criteria ('give a simple home record format covering temperature, pulse and blood pressure if available...').",
